'''Squire Luno''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] gacha event. He was added in [[Version 15.1 Update|Version 15.1]].

